{"id":"0d2436bddbb5a667","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-bestfitunrestricted.md","title":"Unrestricted best fit and its optimum","display":"thm-bestfitunrestricted — Unrestricted best fit and its optimum","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-bestfitunrestricted","aliases":["27-thm-bestfitunrestricted"],"display":"thm-bestfitunrestricted — Unrestricted best fit and its optimum","depends_on":["[[27-df-bestfit]]","[[27-df-fiterror]]","[[27-df-boolfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.4, Theorem 12.17, FALL case, (12.21)","source_printed_pages":"548–549","source_pdf_pages":"572–573","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-bestfitunrestricted"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-bestfitunrestricted</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bestfitunrestricted — Unrestricted best fit and its optimum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"715fc2a2ad4968cc\" href=\"?note=715fc2a2ad4968cc\" title=\"27-df-bestfit\">27-df-bestfit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" href=\"?note=00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" title=\"27-df-fiterror\">27-df-fiterror</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.4, Theorem 12.17, FALL case, (12.21)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"548–549"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"572–573"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>；最优函数族和误差见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"715fc2a2ad4968cc\" href=\"?note=715fc2a2ad4968cc\" title=\"27-df-bestfit\">27-df-bestfit</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_*\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathbb B\">\\(f_*\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathbb B\\)</span> 是下式定义的图。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BestFit}_n,\\mathrm{FitLabel}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BestFit}_n,\\mathrm{FitLabel}_n\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"715fc2a2ad4968cc\" href=\"?note=715fc2a2ad4968cc\" title=\"27-df-bestfit\">27-df-bestfit</a> 的接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Err}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Err}_n\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" href=\"?note=00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" title=\"27-df-fiterror\">27-df-fiterror</a> 的接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a> 的载体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_*\\coloneqq\\{(a,1)\\mid a\\in T\\setminus F\\}\\cup\\{(a,0)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\setminus(T\\setminus F)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_*\\coloneqq\\{(a,1)\\mid a\\in T\\setminus F\\}\\cup\\{(a,0)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\setminus(T\\setminus F)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_*\\in\\mathrm{BestFit}_n(T,F,w;\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n),\\qquad\\min_{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n}\\mathrm{Err}_n(f;T,F,w)=\\mathrm W_w(T\\cap F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_*\\in\\mathrm{BestFit}_n(T,F,w;\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n),\\qquad\\min_{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n}\\mathrm{Err}_n(f;T,F,w)=\\mathrm W_w(T\\cap F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FitLabel}_n(f_*;T,F)=(T\\setminus F,F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FitLabel}_n(f_*;T,F)=(T\\setminus F,F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Theorem 12.17 的 FALL 证明与公式 (12.21)，印刷页 548–549 / PDF 第 572–573 页。图的两分支互斥且覆盖整个立方体，所以定义全函数。每个冲突点必须付 w(a)，其余指定样本均可正确分类；f_* 达到此下界。已核对原书相应陈述与证明，并在此记录完整本地论证。结论允许零权；此时最优解可额外误分零权的无冲突点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-bestfit","status":"resolved","id":"715fc2a2ad4968cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-bestfit]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-fiterror","status":"resolved","id":"00d5aa0e1574d0b4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-fiterror]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"reso